# Engineering Diagrams

## Purpose

This directory contains engineering diagrams developed to explain technical concepts, geological interpretation, engineering solutions and system architecture used throughout the project.

## Content

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| geological-map.png | Geological mapping of the study area |
| geological-cross-section.png | Cross-sectional interpretation |
| mine-layout.png | Underground mine layout |
| engineering-design.png | Proposed engineering design |
| structural-analysis.png | Structural interpretation |
| data-flow-diagram.png | Engineering data flow |

## Accepted Formats

- PNG
- SVG (preferred)
- PDF (vector)
- Draw.io (.drawio)

## Naming Convention

```
<topic>-<description>.<extension>
```

Examples

```
geological-cross-section.png
mine-layout.svg
engineering-design.drawio
structural-analysis.pdf
```

## Guidelines

- Keep diagrams clean and readable.
- Use vector graphics whenever possible.
- Include legends, scales and labels.
- Ensure consistency across the repository.